00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:16.716
Do you think to this point

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:18.551
about the risks

00:05:18.551 --> 00:05:19.986
that the Russians are speaking to

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:21.187
or inside Russia

00:05:21.187 --> 00:05:22.322
who may see this,

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:23.890
that this dark Web browser

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:24.991
that going to tour,

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:26.859
that this is something that

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:29.629
the people would take any enough people,

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:30.963
I guess, would take a risk on

00:05:32.098 --> 00:05:33.333
Well, it's very hard

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:34.634
to strike the right tone.

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:35.702
You know, the kind of message

00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:36.703
that we just heard in

00:05:36.703 --> 00:05:37.570
the segment

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.806
is not going to appeal to everyone.

00:05:39.806 --> 00:05:41.774
Some people are going to laugh it off,

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:43.343
but presumably

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:45.211
they get things out of cooperating

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:46.512
with the intelligence services.

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:48.481
This they might get some payments.

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:50.183
They might get security.

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:50.416
You know,

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:52.352
these are things that Russians

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:53.119
many Russians

00:05:53.119 --> 00:05:54.821
are really craving right now.

00:05:54.821 --> 00:05:57.323
So there is a certain appeal there.

00:05:57.323 --> 00:05:57.523
Is it

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:59.692
going to reach a large number of people?

00:05:59.926 --> 00:06:01.060
We don't know.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.195
But I think the CIA

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:04.030
