00:06:15.241 --> 00:06:15.675
people come

00:06:15.675 --> 00:06:16.909
and going from the Russian embassy.

00:06:16.909 --> 00:06:18.211
And it does make you realize

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:20.079
there are a lot of people

00:06:20.079 --> 00:06:22.181
