00:06:30.656 --> 00:06:32.225
places in the United Arab

00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:33.393
Emirates, for example.

00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:37.063
Do you think that there's been success

00:06:37.063 --> 00:06:38.931
