00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:41.834
Again, it's hard to know.

00:06:41.834 --> 00:06:42.702
We don't know what

00:06:42.702 --> 00:06:44.704
the intelligence agencies are doing.

00:06:44.704 --> 00:06:45.371
They're not going to share

00:06:45.371 --> 00:06:47.640
