00:06:52.512 --> 00:06:54.147
It's not easy to get a tourist visa.

00:06:54.147 --> 00:06:55.681
Of course, for most Russians,

00:06:55.681 --> 00:06:57.049
but those who have the

00:06:57.049 --> 00:06:57.683
the money

00:06:57.683 --> 00:06:58.951
