00:07:31.918 --> 00:07:32.752
They don't want to live

00:07:32.752 --> 00:07:33.886
in an oppressive society

00:07:33.886 --> 00:07:35.254
with a bleak future.

00:07:35.254 --> 00:07:35.788
All right.

00:07:35.822 --> 00:07:37.356
